  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Propyl alcohol&nbsp;undergo nucleophilic substitution reaction with thionyl chloride to give propyl chloride. Propyl chloride give butane nitrile on reaction with potasium cyanide. Butane nitrile on reduction give butyl amine.<img src=\"assets\\st0105_0adfc1f34ec2.png\" style=\"width: 469px; height: 147px;\" /></p>"
